1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,562
A longitudinal incision was made over the dorsal aspect of the first metatarsal.

2
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,926
The foot was degloved to expose the metatarsal head.

3
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:32,530
Two osteotomies were performed using a bone saw and an oscillating saw.

4
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:39,644
A drilling procedure was then performed on the metatarsal head.
